### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "shimi",
    "email": "shimi@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "shimi@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Variables from login response
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Protected Route Test (Example)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/test-protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Variables (Update after Login)
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Update Profile with Image
# Note: Ensure the file 'test_image.png' exists in the same folder as this .rest file
PUT http://localhost:3000/user/update
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="username"

shimi_updated
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test_image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test_image.png
